      <title>Orbit 2026.11.8.1955</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:55:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611081955</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2026.11.8.1955</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:releaseNotesLink>https://github.com/siosphere/orbit-updates/releases/tag/v202611081955</sparkle:releaseNotesLink>
      <orbit:note>Windows: create a new space, see the sidebar slide on switch, and swipe between spaces with a touchpad.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>The Windows menu now includes commands for reopening closed tabs, switching tabs, pinning, and reloading pages.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Windows sidebar now matches Mac: hover close buttons, space name labels, a Clear button, and width stays the same in every window.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Web pages can no longer open internal diagnostic pages.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>The Ctrl+Tab tab switcher now appears centered over the page instead of pinned to the left edge.</orbit:note>
